# The sources of the static native binaries. build_static.sh and make-manifest.sh read this file.
# Without a pin, every build took the newest termux-packages: on 2026-09-23 that brought NDK r30,
# and all binaries since then stopped at start on Linux older than 4.14.
# To move a pin: change it in its own commit, build, and run the new bundle on a phone with Linux
# older than 4.14 and on a phone with a new kernel before binary_version.txt pins it.

# termux-packages master on 2026-11-05 18:21 UTC: the source of binaries-2026-11-05_18-58 (NDK r30).
# Its aria2c shows this commit time ("built on: Thu Nov  5 18:21:04 2026 UTC").
TERMUX_PACKAGES_COMMIT=0220f1ac13df82707a357bd585320cd8e836c690
# ghcr.io/termux/package-builder "latest" since 2026-10-23: the image of that same build.
TERMUX_BUILDER_IMAGE=ghcr.io/termux/package-builder@sha256:e2de051a518d8b188c59c4a1ecf357d373b9ccf48d6c06d7681fdc3f61a77287
